# Normalise line endings.
#
# Git for Windows commonly sets core.autocrlf=true, which would check shell
# scripts out with CRLF and break `bash -n` and every `scripts/*.sh` run. This
# forces LF in the working tree for every text file, on every platform, so what
# a contributor runs matches what CI runs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets are never normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
